{"id":"msg_m_s004_06","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_edenspear_s","label":"Dorothy · Chat"},"label":"1. Papillon.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_s004_10","speakers":{"dorothy":"Dorothy","papillon":"Papillon"},"icons":{"dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","papillon":"si_c890_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_s004_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_1","text":"Papillon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_2","text":"Oh my gosh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_3","text":"Dorothy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_4","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_5","text":"Are you in the Ark?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_6","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_7","text":"Hang on,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_8","text":"I'll make a group chat and invite everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_9","text":"Don't do that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_10","text":"There's something I need to talk to you about.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_11","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_12","text":"Me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_13","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_14","text":"There is a tablet in your room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_15","text":"The password is \"pinne\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_16","text":"Please send me the data inside the folder named \"A\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_17","text":"Be sure to send it from that tablet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_18","text":"Otherwise, Enikk or Cecil will trace it back to you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_19","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_20","text":"Eden's metalworking technology.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_21","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_22","text":"What are you up to?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_23","text":"I'm going to give your beloved Ark a gift.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_24","text":"Up to some industrial espionage?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_25","text":"That's an interesting way to put it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_26","text":"I'd appreciate it if you could send it quickly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_27","text":"I was in such a rush, so I only managed to bring my optical camouflage.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_28","text":"So you're asking me to help with an intelligence leak,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_29","text":"is that right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_30","text":"That's about right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_31","text":"If I get caught and killed, are you gonna be the one responsible?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_32","text":"Yet another amusing comment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_33","text":"Weren't you risking your life from the very start when you went up there?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_34","text":"Why bring it up now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_35","text":"True that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_36","text":"But something about it feels off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_37","text":"Good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_38","text":"You're cautious, as you should be.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_39","text":"I'll act as the goodwill ambassador, bridging Eden and the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_40","text":"And sharing technology is an enticement to make that happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_41","text":"You call it sharing, hahaha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_42","text":"But it's really just a covert leak.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_43","text":"For now, yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_44","text":"But if things go according to plan,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_45","text":"the Ark will experience unprecedented prosperity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_46","text":"And do you know what kind of future awaits you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_47","text":"my willing and eager ally?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_48","text":"Oh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_49","text":"You won't need to risk your life going up to the surface anymore,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_50","text":"nor conduct espionage while constantly watching your back.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_51","text":"That sounds quite tempting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_52","text":"I figured you'd say that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_53","text":"All you need to do is send me the data I want","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_54","text":"at the right time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_55","text":"That's all there is to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_56","text":"Easy, isn't it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_57","text":"So easy, it's almost suspicious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_58","text":"It's practically a miracle that you're in Eden right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_59","text":"I hope you'll truly enjoy every moment of it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_60","text":"Can I think about it for a moment?","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_61","text":"By all means.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"papillon","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_62","text":"I'll do it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_63","text":"That was quick.","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_64","text":"All right,","jump":null},{"id":"m_s004_06_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SideStory:m_s004_06_65","text":"I'll be waiting.","jump":null}],"chat":true}